# Point-to-point end-effector goal (see CONTRACT.md).
#
# Absolute (relative = false): the EE pose in the controller's base frame;
# header.frame_id must be empty or that frame. Relative (relative = true): the
# EE's displacement from its pose when the goal starts, expressed in the EE
# frame; header.frame_id must be empty or the EE frame. Controllers do not
# transform between frames, so any other frame is rejected.
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target_pose
bool relative
# The motion takes at least this long [s]; longer if the Cartesian limits require.
float64 duration_sec
---
# Define the result
bool is_completed
# Empty on success. On failure this carries the reason the goal did not
# complete, so operator clients can print it instead of a bare failure.
string message
---
# Define a feedback message
float32 percent_complete
